        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p><strong>Lawkeepers</strong> are an overwhelming force when they work in tandem—their Carbine attack allows them to knock enemies Prone, creating an opportunity for other lawkeepers to move in and surround a target with their In Pursuit reactions. On the lawkeeper’s next turn, they use their Arrest action to detain the target.</p><p>Should a lawkeeper question a suspect or detainee, the lawkeeper’s Eye of the Law feature puts pressure on anyone who tries to lie to them.</p>",
        "role": "rival"
    },
